# 两个服务统一使用仓库根目录作为构建上下文。
# 首先忽略所有文件
**

# Codex 仅包含应用源码、共享配置和构建输入。
!bridge/
bridge/**
!bridge/Dockerfile
!bridge/pyproject.toml
!bridge/uv.lock
!bridge/README.md
!bridge/__init__.py
!bridge/main.py
!bridge/configs/
bridge/configs/**
!bridge/configs/*.json
!bridge/configs/*.py
!bridge/codex/
bridge/codex/**
!bridge/codex/*.py
!bridge/middleware/
bridge/middleware/**
!bridge/middleware/*.py
!bridge/session/
bridge/session/**
!bridge/session/*.py
!bridge/services/
bridge/services/**
!bridge/services/*.py
!bridge/services/lark/
bridge/services/lark/**
!bridge/services/lark/*.py
!bridge/utils/
bridge/utils/**
!bridge/utils/*.py
!bridge/docker/
bridge/docker/**
!bridge/docker/entrypoint.sh

# MCP 保留整个目录内容
!mcp_service/
!mcp_service/**

# 公共排除规则必须放在白名单之后，避免被重新包含。
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
**/build
**/dist
**/.env
**/.git
**/tests
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/skills-office
**/skills